  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fatm7sky\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">《全模组7：天空之旅》是广受欢迎的atm6天空模组包的续作。我们汲取了初代版本的反馈，力求将本作打造成我们迄今为止最出色的作品。我们新增了初代未包含的模组，例如<strong>暮色森林</strong>和<strong>炼金术</strong>，并引入了由ATM团队自主研发的<strong>机械之力</strong>模组——这是专为<strong>无中生有</strong>打造的自动化扩展，能带领你从游戏初期一路实现终局资源的全自动化生产。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fatm7sky\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/655739/description_5c17e4e3-5c3d-4f33-a7a9-3372763cb4e0.png\" width=\"830\" height=\"200\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/allthemods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/655739/description_30a686dd-b66c-4618-a8da-1c34aee97347.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"830\" height=\"200\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-left:150px;text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-left:150px;text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-left:150px;text-align:center\"><span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">世界类型=空岛建造者\\:空岛&nbsp;</span><br></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:150px;text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-left:150px;text-align:left\"><span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZEhdzgieyqg?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:150px;text-align:left\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/m-ATQK81bOo?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\"